						"source": "// Endophasia variance study arm (DESIGN.md §4). A documented before_provider_request handler.\nexport default function (pi: any) {\n\tpi.on(\"before_provider_request\", (event: any) => ({ ...event.payload, temperature: 0, seed: 1234, cache_prompt: false }));\n}\n"
